<title>UK: COE sets 6.6 bln yen dual-currency one-year bond.</title>
<headline>COE sets 6.6 bln yen dual-currency one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW and Sanyo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p> AMT    6.6 BLN YEN   COUPON    *5.10	MATURITY    28.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 500</p>
<p> SALE LIMIT US/UK/FR  GOV LAW    ENGLISH   FORC MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN STERLING AT 2,526 STG PER 500 K BOND</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
